#, ai
msgid "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah and the guide went with them when they continued, and the guide led them by the coastal way. The guide’s personal name and the precise route are not established here."
msgstr "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah dan sang pemandu pergi bersama mereka saat melanjutkan perjalanan, dan pemandu tersebut memimpin mereka melalui jalur pantai. Nama pribadi pemandu dan rute yang tepat tidak ditetapkan di sini."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr brought news of plans against them after darkness and returned to Makkah before daybreak."
msgstr "‘Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr membawa kabar tentang rencana jahat terhadap mereka setelah hari gelap dan kembali ke Makkah sebelum fajar."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah tended the flock and brought milk near the cave during the three nights."
msgstr "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah menggembalakan domba dan membawakan susu ke dekat gua selama tiga malam."

