#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "In Ibn Ishaq’s account, “as it reached me,” ‘Ali stayed behind for another reason too. People in Makkah had left their valuables with the Prophet ﷺ for safekeeping, knowing his honesty; the report says ‘Ali was to return their deposits."
msgstr "Dalam riwayat Ibnu Ishaq, dengan ungkapan “sebagaimana yang sampai kepadaku”, Ali juga tinggal karena alasan lain. Penduduk Makkah menitipkan harta mereka kepada Nabi ﷺ karena mereka mengenal kejujurannya; riwayat itu menyebutkan bahwa Ali akan mengembalikan titipan mereka."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "Further on they stopped at the tent of Umm Ma‘bad of Khuza‘ah and asked for hospitality. She said they had no food and no milk-giving ewe."
msgstr "Kemudian, dalam perjalanan, mereka singgah di kemah Ummu Ma'bad dari Khuza'ah dan meminta jamuan. Ia berkata bahwa mereka tidak memiliki makanan ataupun domba betina yang menghasilkan susu."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "The report says the Prophet ﷺ called for one of her sheep, passed his hand over its udder and called on Allah. He milked it into a large vessel until it frothed, and said: drink, Umm Ma‘bad. Ibn Kathir notes that her story is well known and comes through routes that strengthen one another."
msgstr "Riwayat itu menyebutkan bahwa Nabi ﷺ meminta salah satu domba miliknya, mengusap ambingnya dengan tangan beliau, lalu berdoa kepada Allah. Beliau memerahnya ke dalam wadah besar hingga berbuih, lalu berkata, “Minumlah, Ummu Ma'bad.” Ibnu Katsir mencatat bahwa kisahnya terkenal dan diriwayatkan melalui jalur-jalur yang saling menguatkan."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "According to ‘Urwa, he stayed among them for a few more than ten nights. There he founded the mosque that the account calls the one founded on piety, and he prayed in it."
msgstr "Menurut riwayat Urwah, beliau tinggal di antara mereka selama beberapa malam lebih dari sepuluh malam. Di sana beliau mendirikan masjid yang menurut riwayat didirikan atas dasar ketakwaan, dan salat di dalamnya."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "They stopped at Umm Ma‘bad’s tent. She said they had no food or milk-giving ewe; the report then describes milk from one of her sheep."
msgstr "Mereka singgah di kemah Ummu Ma'bad. Ia berkata bahwa mereka tidak memiliki makanan ataupun domba betina yang menghasilkan susu; lalu riwayat itu mengisahkan pemerahan salah satu dombanya."

